.TH rune-term-ctl-info 1
.SH NAME
\fBrune\-term\-ctl\-info\fR \- Print basic CLI/protocol information.
.SH SYNOPSIS
rune\-term\-ctl info [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print basic CLI/protocol information.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output machine\-readable JSON.
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR\fI <PATH>\fR
Path to the control socket.
